# Packaged desktop app. electron-builder writes a ~330MB installer and a
# 235MB unpacked tree here on every build; GitHub refuses any blob over
# 100MB, so committing this makes the repo unpushable rather than merely
# large. Build it with `npm run app:dist` instead of cloning it.
release/

# Staging folder for handing the installer to someone else.
share/

# Local archives.
*.zip
